<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Llanberis Bike Hire" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Llanberis Bike Hire - Route C: Bwlch Maesgwm (Telegraph Pass)</name>
    <desc>A proper mountain day: the long climb to Bwlch Maesgwm between Foel Goch and Moel Cynghorion, down to the Snowdon Ranger Path and back over the hill from Waunfawr. Grade: Challenging. About 23.4 km with 651 m of climbing. Start and finish: Llanberis Bike Hire, in the yard behind 34 High Street. Route line drawn on OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL).</desc>
    <author><name>Llanberis Bike Hire</name></author>
    <link href="https://www.llanberisbikehire.co.uk"><text>Llanberis Bike Hire</text></link>
  </metadata>
